    ],
    "text": "Regulations under Sections 32 and 33",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      469.09,
      546.34,
      516.16
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me, under Sections 32(b) and 33 of the Sports Act, No. 25 of 1973, I, Harin Fernando,Minister of Telecommunication, Foreign Employment and Sports, suspend the registration, with immediate effect, of theSri Lanka Judo Association, the National Association for the Sport of Judo and appoint the following Interim Committeeto continue the activities thereof as a provisional arrangement.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      98.01,
      529.09,
      371.97,
      564.16
    ],
    "text": "1.Mr. W. S. E. Jayasundara-President2.Dr. (Mr.) K. A. P. Kiriella-Member3.Mrs. D. M. S. S. Basnayake-Member",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      577.09,
      546.42,
      612.16
    ],
    "text": "And, I do hereby authorize the Director General of the Department of Sports Development to convene a SpecialGeneral Meeting of the Judo Association and appoint an Election Committee in terms of the Sports Act, No. 25 of 1973and subsequent amendments made thereto and convene and conduct the election under supervision of the Director General.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      625.09,
      517.67,
      684.16
    ],
